@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Junailijat – Vercel-demo (tuotanto) ja CD-putki

actor "Kehittäjä" as Developer
actor "Demokäyttäjä" as DemoUser

cloud "GitHub\nbdh283ako/Junailijat_ako_coreproto" as GitHub {
  component "main-haara\n(git push origin main)" as MainBranch
  component "PR / feature-haara" as PrBranch
}

cloud "Vercel – projekti junailijat-ako-coreproto" as Vercel {
  component "CD: main → Production\nPR → Preview-deploy" as CD
  node "Build-kone" as BuildMachine {
    component "pnpm install\n(pnpm-lock.yaml, packageManager pnpm@10.34.9)" as Install
    component "pnpm run build = next build (Next.js 16.4.6)\nei vercel.jsonia; .vercelignore rajaa pois\n.env.*, *.ps1, node_modules, .next" as Build
  }
  node "Vercel Functions (Node.js)" as Runtime {
    package "Next.js App Router" {
      [React-käyttöliittymä] as UI
      [Sovellus-API:t /api/*] as Routes
      [Auth.js / NextAuth\nGoogle Provider] as Auth
      [Payload CMS 4.0.0-beta.8] as Payload
       [Vercel Web Analytics\n@vercel/analytics] as Analytics
    }
    component "PostgreSQL-adapteri\n@payloadcms/db-postgres" as DBAdapter
  }
}

database "Neon PostgreSQL\n(Vercel-integraatio)" as Neon

cloud "Google Identity\nOAuth 2.0 / OIDC" as Google
cloud "EventPulse / Linked Events / Kauniainen" as Feeds

Developer --> GitHub : git push
MainBranch --> CD
PrBranch --> CD
CD --> Install
Install --> Build
Build --> Runtime : deployment
DemoUser --> UI : https://junailijat-ako-coreproto-junailijat.vercel.app
UI --> Routes
UI --> Auth
Auth --> Google
Routes --> Payload
Payload --> DBAdapter
DBAdapter --> Neon : DATABASE_URL || POSTGRES_URL
Routes --> Feeds

note right of Neon
  Ympäristömuuttujat Vercelissä (Production/Preview/Development):
  DATABASE_URL, POSTGRES_URL (+ Neonin POSTGRES_*),
  PAYLOAD_SECRET, AUTH_SECRET, AUTH_GOOGLE_ID,
  AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET, NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL.
  Hallinta: Vercel-dashboard tai `vercel env` – ei koskaan commitiin.
  Skeema: push=false → migraatiot ajetaan tarkoituksella
  Neonia vastaan (payload migrate), ei automaattisesti buildissa.
  Paikallinen Docker-PG ja Neon ovat eri tietokantoja.
end note

note bottom of Build
  Älä deployaa `vercel --prod` -CLI:lla Windows-koneelta:
  CRLF-rivinvaihdot rikkovat buildin
  (ELIFECYCLE -2 / BUILD_UTILS_SPAWN_254).
  .gitattributes (* text=auto eol=lf) pitää LF-muodon;
  ensisijainen deploy-tapa on CD-putki (git push).
end note

@enduml
